  aciklama:
  - "\u0130lk fincan foto\u011Fraf\u0131n\u0131n ayd\u0131nl\u0131k k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda
    seni, sa\u011F elini \xF6ne do\u011Fru \"\xF6pt\xFCrmek \xFCzere\" uzatm\u0131\u015F
    gibi g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Kar\u015F\u0131nda ise ya\u015Fl\u0131ca, ba\u015F\u0131
    takkeli, ak sakall\u0131 bir adam var {{isim}}. Bu adam, elinde tuttu\u011Fu
    \"ser\xE7e parma\u011F\u0131ndan daha k\xFC\xE7\xFCk say\u0131labilecek\" koku
    \u015Fi\u015Fesinin kapa\u011F\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7\u0131p \xE7evirmi\u015F ve
    elinin d\u0131\u015F k\u0131sm\u0131na adeta \"misk\" s\xFCr\xFCyor. G\xF6nl\xFC
    tevhid ile dolu gibi g\xF6z\xFCken ve s\u0131rt\u0131ndan g\xF6\u011Fe do\u011Fru
    parlak bir \u0131\u015F\u0131k h\xFCzmesi uzanan bu adam\u0131n, evlili\u011Finle
    ilgili dualar\u0131ndan birine yan\u0131t alaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6stergesi
    bir evliya, asfiya ya da veli oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum."
